Validate live change coverage, substantive review freshness and captured required checks.
Usage: repo-audit.mjs evidence validate --repo <path> --base <ref> --assessment <file> [--contract <repo-relative-file>] [--previous-contract <base-policy-path>] [--json]
Previous policy defaults to .bstack/project.json at the base; custom prior authority requires --previous-contract. Assessment follows schemas/evidence.schema.json. Returns the current review fingerprint; review must bind it explicitly. Missing prior policy, decisions or checks block completion. Structural validation cannot prove semantic correctness.
